# Never ship host artifacts into the image. Beyond size, copying the host's node_modules over the
# container's would clobber the install performed inside the build stage — pnpm's node_modules is a
# tree of symlinks into a store that does not exist in the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.next

# The gateway is a separate service with its own Dockerfile; it must never be baked into this image.
gateway

.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.log
data
docs
